<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.400" end="00:00:05.639" style="s2">Is anyone willing to marry my dad?</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.680" end="00:00:09.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want a mom.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.400" end="00:00:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo, see which one you&#39;d like is your</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.480" end="00:00:16.880" style="s2">mom. If I marry Dante, can I use his</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.880" end="00:00:18.800" style="s2">black card however I want? As the wife</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.880" end="00:00:20.080" style="s2">of the godfather, will the entire mob</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.800" end="00:00:22.720" style="s2">have to answer to me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.080" end="00:00:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then which one of you will play with me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.720" end="00:00:28.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll just get a nanny for you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.000" end="00:00:31.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You only care about dad&#39;s money. You</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.560" end="00:00:32.960" style="s2">don&#39;t like me at all. I&#39;m going to FIND</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.359" end="00:00:34.960" style="s2">A MOM MYSELF.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.960" end="00:00:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making a kid this young look for a wife?</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.960" end="00:00:38.000" style="s2">What kind of father does that?</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.480" end="00:00:40.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And he tells the kid he&#39;s some kind of</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.000" end="00:00:43.040" style="s2">godfather. Yeah. No way. I trust him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.239" end="00:00:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dad isn&#39;t like that.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.040" end="00:00:46.719" style="s2">I&#39;m looking for a husband for my mom,</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.800" end="00:00:49.600" style="s2">too. If they get married, we&#39;ll both</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.719" end="00:00:52.640" style="s2">have a mom and a dad. Really? Will your</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.600" end="00:00:56.199" style="s2">mom like me? My mom is super gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.640" end="00:00:56.199" style="s2">You&#39;ll love her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.960" end="00:01:02.559" style="s2">Sweetie, what&#39;s up?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.399" end="00:01:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;ve got great news.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.559" end="00:01:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your time. I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.040" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dad is super patient, too. He never</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">loses his temper.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.600" end="00:01:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That FBI agent coden named Night Andale</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.680" end="00:01:23.159" style="s2">wrecked our plans again. Find her. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.920" end="00:01:23.159" style="s2">done waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.960" end="00:01:29.360" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.159" end="00:01:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, buddy. What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.360" end="00:01:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. The Godfather slipped away</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.520" end="00:01:35.680" style="s2">again. But I swear I&#39;m going to catch</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.840" end="00:01:39.520" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.680" end="00:01:43.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to find whoever this is.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.520" end="00:01:48.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad. Mom, we found exactly who you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.360" end="00:01:48.920" style="s2">been looking for. Hurry to the park.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.600" end="00:01:53.759" style="s2">My dad is in charge of so many people</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.840" end="00:01:55.600" style="s2">and they&#39;re all terrified of him. My</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.759" end="00:01:57.439" style="s2">mom, too. Then they must be in the same</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.600" end="00:02:00.439" style="s2">line of work. They&#39;ll definitely hit it</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.439" end="00:02:00.439" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.040" end="00:02:07.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.079" end="00:02:07.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.599" end="00:02:18.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, here&#39;s the wife I found for you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.760" end="00:02:18.599" style="s2">Mom, here&#39;s the husband I found for you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.200" end="00:02:24.599" style="s2">Get married.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.160" end="00:02:30.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kids cook this up on their own. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.840" end="00:02:32.800" style="s2">hope you don&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.959" end="00:02:34.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son was in on it, too.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.800" end="00:02:36.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Dante, Theo&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.879" end="00:02:37.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey. Should we get to know each other</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.959" end="00:02:40.080" style="s2">first?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.519" end="00:02:42.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.080" end="00:02:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep my identity to myself for now</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.080" end="00:02:46.480" style="s2">and see if she can accept an ordinary</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.760" end="00:02:48.000" style="s2">guy. I work as a security guard. The pay</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.480" end="00:02:49.680" style="s2">isn&#39;t great and I work a lot of night</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.000" end="00:02:51.840" style="s2">shifts.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.680" end="00:02:53.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a blind date. No need to bring</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.840" end="00:02:56.080" style="s2">up that I&#39;m with the FBI. I collect</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.760" end="00:02:58.480" style="s2">debts. I go wherever the job takes me,</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.080" end="00:03:02.080" style="s2">so the money isn&#39;t exactly steady.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.480" end="00:03:05.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mom is lying again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.080" end="00:03:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still about being a security guard.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.120" end="00:03:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If my job bothers you, you don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.720" end="00:03:11.560" style="s2">force yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.080" end="00:03:11.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go, Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.200" end="00:03:17.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like it&#39;s ending just like before.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.480" end="00:03:21.519" style="s2">Well, what are you waiting for? Come</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.480" end="00:03:22.159" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.519" end="00:03:23.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.159" end="00:03:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else? Bring Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.599" end="00:03:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.440" end="00:03:30.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here we are. The benefits are way better</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.200" end="00:03:30.840" style="s2">than your current job.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.519" end="00:03:43.840" style="s2">I&#39;m a mafia boss and my blind date just</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.159" end="00:03:46.480" style="s2">brought me to a police station to apply</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.840" end="00:03:49.040" style="s2">for a security job. Talk about walking</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.480" end="00:03:51.200" style="s2">straight into the lion&#39;s den.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.040" end="00:03:53.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, doesn&#39;t this job seem perfect for</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.200" end="00:03:56.760" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.760" end="00:03:56.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.599" end="00:04:02.480" style="s2">See, they&#39;re hiring dayshift security.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.920" end="00:04:05.040" style="s2">Set hours, steady pay, and you&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.480" end="00:04:06.720" style="s2">more time for Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.040" end="00:04:08.239" style="s2">I asked you all those questions earlier</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.720" end="00:04:10.000" style="s2">just because I wanted to help you find a</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.239" end="00:04:11.439" style="s2">job. I hope you didn&#39;t get the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.000" end="00:04:13.040" style="s2">idea.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.439" end="00:04:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you don&#39;t look down on what I do?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.040" end="00:04:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. Working all on your own</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.120" end="00:04:18.479" style="s2">while taking care of a kid is hard work.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.040" end="00:04:21.040" style="s2">If you have the chance to get an easier</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.479" end="00:04:22.880" style="s2">job, why not take it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.040" end="00:04:24.240" style="s2">Theo, would you like to have dinner with</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.880" end="00:04:26.240" style="s2">your dad every single night?</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.240" end="00:04:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Dad. Does that mean you can finish</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.240" end="00:04:30.000" style="s2">telling me bedtime stories, too? Or my</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.160" end="00:04:32.160" style="s2">mom can read bedtime stories to you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.000" end="00:04:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wasn&#39;t judging my work. She was</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.160" end="00:04:36.479" style="s2">looking out for Theo and I. Thank you,</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.000" end="00:04:38.639" style="s2">Audrey, but security requirements at a</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.479" end="00:04:40.080" style="s2">police station must be pretty high. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.639" end="00:04:42.320" style="s2">just an ordinary guard. I might not make</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.080" end="00:04:43.840" style="s2">the cut. How about we look around</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.320" end="00:04:47.800" style="s2">somewhere else?</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.840" end="00:04:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, I can handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.840" end="00:04:54.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you a debt collector? How could</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.360" end="00:04:56.118" style="s2">you pull strings at a police station?</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.098" end="00:04:56.118" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.993" end="00:05:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.400" end="00:05:04.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because an officer here owes money and</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.720" end="00:05:06.000" style="s2">it just so happens I&#39;m the one</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.080" end="00:05:07.600" style="s2">collecting that debt.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.000" end="00:05:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You even dare to collect from police</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.600" end="00:05:10.800" style="s2">officers?</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.800" end="00:05:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If my job is a problem for you, say it</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.800" end="00:05:14.960" style="s2">now. We don&#39;t have to force this just</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.800" end="00:05:18.280" style="s2">for the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.960" end="00:05:18.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.479" end="00:05:22.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But your income isn&#39;t steady either. If</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.800" end="00:05:24.240" style="s2">you give him extra time, won&#39;t that hurt</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.320" end="00:05:25.680" style="s2">your pay?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.240" end="00:05:27.520" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to take a financial hit</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.680" end="00:05:29.280" style="s2">for us.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.520" end="00:05:31.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it makes life a little easier for you</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.280" end="00:05:33.759" style="s2">and Theo, waiting a few days is no big</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.360" end="00:05:36.240" style="s2">deal. Don&#39;t worry, I won&#39;t let Lily go</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.759" end="00:05:38.240" style="s2">without.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.240" end="00:05:39.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Audrey.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.240" end="00:05:41.680" style="s2">If dad doesn&#39;t have to work nights</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.919" end="00:05:44.000" style="s2">anymore, can I bring him with me when I</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.680" end="00:05:48.039" style="s2">come see you? Yes, I have tons of toys</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.000" end="00:05:48.039" style="s2">and I can share them with you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.039" end="00:05:56.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Collecting dits. Do you deal with gangs</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.440" end="00:05:57.280" style="s2">a lot? Doesn&#39;t it get dangerous?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.080" end="00:05:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some people need a little extra</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.280" end="00:06:00.080" style="s2">convincing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.240" end="00:06:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do they get physical with you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.080" end="00:06:05.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes, but I&#39;m not afraid. They</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.720" end="00:06:08.319" style="s2">can&#39;t intimidate me. But honestly,</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.039" end="00:06:09.840" style="s2">they&#39;re the ones who should be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.319" end="00:06:11.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That kind of work is no place for a</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.840" end="00:06:13.280" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.199" end="00:06:16.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just helped him find a job and now</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.280" end="00:06:16.840" style="s2">he&#39;s judging mine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.600" end="00:06:23.440" style="s2">If you have an issue with what I do, you</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.199" end="00:06:25.120" style="s2">can say it right now. There&#39;s no need to</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.440" end="00:06:28.080" style="s2">force yourself for the kid&#39;s sake.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.120" end="00:06:31.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, that&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.080" end="00:06:32.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love my work and I&#39;m good at it. I</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.280" end="00:06:34.319" style="s2">don&#39;t want anyone thinking I&#39;m unfit</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.639" end="00:06:36.479" style="s2">just because I&#39;m a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.319" end="00:06:38.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I phrased that poorly. I didn&#39;t mean a</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.479" end="00:06:39.520" style="s2">woman can&#39;t do the job. I just meant</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.160" end="00:06:40.960" style="s2">that having you out on the front lines</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.520" end="00:06:41.919" style="s2">chasing down debts is a waste of your</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.960" end="00:06:43.919" style="s2">talents.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.919" end="00:06:47.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A waste of my talents.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.919" end="00:06:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should be the one calling the shots.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.039" end="00:06:50.960" style="s2">You have the guts to negotiate with a</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.800" end="00:06:52.560" style="s2">cop. You know when to give people</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.960" end="00:06:56.400" style="s2">breathing room and you know how to</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.560" end="00:06:58.319" style="s2">handle them. You&#39;re a natural leader.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.400" end="00:07:01.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I actually do lead a team. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.319" end="00:07:02.319" style="s2">surprisingly sharp at reading people.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.169" end="00:07:04.960" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.319" end="00:07:06.720" style="s2">You&#39;re pretty good at reading people.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.960" end="00:07:09.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Working security. Reading people is part</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.720" end="00:07:09.960" style="s2">of the job.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.720" end="00:07:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I want to take Lily home to play.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.039" end="00:07:18.800" style="s2">Mom, can I go over and play?</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.000" end="00:07:20.160" style="s2">Theo likes her so much. I&#39;d like to see</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.800" end="00:07:22.080" style="s2">what it feels like with the four of us</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.160" end="00:07:23.919" style="s2">together, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.080" end="00:07:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you like to come over to my place?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.919" end="00:07:28.560" style="s2">Let them play a bit longer.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.120" end="00:07:31.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.560" end="00:07:31.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yay.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.880" end="00:07:42.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your place is here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.120" end="00:07:42.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.440" end="00:07:48.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s right here. And over there,</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.639" end="00:07:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; that&#39;s where I work. I&#39;m a security</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.479" end="00:07:52.319" style="s2">guard for the neighborhood and I rent</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.000" end="00:07:54.800" style="s2">nearby to keep the commute easy. Come</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.319" end="00:07:56.319" style="s2">on, let&#39;s go inside. Luca, find me a</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.800" end="00:07:58.800" style="s2">rundown rental near the villas right</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.319" end="00:08:00.479" style="s2">now. What about the furniture? Should I</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.800" end="00:08:02.319" style="s2">have people move some from here?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.479" end="00:08:04.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Make it look like the kind of place</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.319" end="00:08:09.639" style="s2">an ordinary security could afford.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.560" end="00:08:09.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. I&#39;ll handle it right away.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.800" end="00:08:18.080" style="s2">Dad, why aren&#39;t we going back to Dad</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.599" end="00:08:19.039" style="s2">moved us out of our own house just to</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.080" end="00:08:20.879" style="s2">look broke?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.039" end="00:08:22.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a bit small, but it&#39;s close to</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.879" end="00:08:23.759" style="s2">where I work, so it&#39;s convenient when I</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.240" end="00:08:27.240" style="s2">come back from night shifts.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.759" end="00:08:27.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You go first.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.560" end="00:08:32.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.280" end="00:08:34.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can we live in a place like this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.399" end="00:08:37.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turns out she&#39;s just like all the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.959" end="00:08:40.080" style="s2">It&#39;s perfect for you and Theo, but if</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.680" end="00:08:42.959" style="s2">we&#39;re really going to live here as a</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.080" end="00:08:44.320" style="s2">family, it&#39;s too cramped. I&#39;ll pitch in</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.959" end="00:08:44.959" style="s2">and we&#39;ll rent someplace bigger</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.320" end="00:08:46.959" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.959" end="00:08:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t think being with me would be</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.959" end="00:08:49.519" style="s2">too hard on you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.839" end="00:08:51.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It might be, but if we&#39;re building a</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.519" end="00:08:54.480" style="s2">home together, then we face it together.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.680" end="00:08:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, together. This time, I really</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.480" end="00:08:58.959" style="s2">want to get married.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.440" end="00:09:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, it&#39;s almost noon. I&#39;m starving. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.959" end="00:09:02.240" style="s2">hungry, too. Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.720" end="00:09:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; why don&#39;t you take them to wash their</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.240" end="00:09:05.920" style="s2">hands? I&#39;ll handle the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.440" end="00:09:14.880" style="s2">Mommy, look. All clean.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.760" end="00:09:17.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good job.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.880" end="00:09:19.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, can I call you mommy, too? Just</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.920" end="00:09:23.440" style="s2">like Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.839" end="00:09:25.360" style="s2">I&#39;ve wanted a mom for a really long</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.440" end="00:09:27.839" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.360" end="00:09:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so nice. I don&#39;t want anyone</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.839" end="00:09:34.880" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.800" end="00:09:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo, don&#39;t call me mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.880" end="00:09:41.240" style="s2">She&#39;s willing to build a life with me,</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.640" end="00:09:41.240" style="s2">but she still won&#39;t accept my son.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.279" end="00:09:48.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you not like me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.800" end="00:09:51.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do like you a lot, but calling someone</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.320" end="00:09:52.720" style="s2">mommy is a big deal. Your dad and I</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.279" end="00:09:55.279" style="s2">still need to make sure we&#39;re really</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.720" end="00:09:57.279" style="s2">ready to become a family. If we get</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.279" end="00:09:58.560" style="s2">married, I definitely want you to call</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.279" end="00:09:59.200" style="s2">me mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.560" end="00:10:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.200" end="00:10:03.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? So, give us a little time. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.680" end="00:10:04.560" style="s2">So, she just didn&#39;t want Theo to get</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.360" end="00:10:06.320" style="s2">hurt again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.560" end="00:10:09.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I don&#39;t want him to be</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.320" end="00:10:09.640" style="s2">hurt again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.120" end="00:10:14.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank [snorts] you, Dante.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.440" end="00:10:19.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, look. I drew our family. This is</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.480" end="00:10:20.800" style="s2">for you,</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.200" end="00:10:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily. One thing in this picture isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.800" end="00:10:26.160" style="s2">right. Let&#39;s draw it again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.720" end="00:10:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I do it wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.160" end="00:10:32.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She drew herself</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.160" end="00:10:36.079" style="s2">outside the door. Does Lily secretly</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.720" end="00:10:40.560" style="s2">not want to accept Dante?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.079" end="00:10:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, do you not like Dante?</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.560" end="00:10:47.279" style="s2">I do like him, but I heard that</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.000" end="00:10:50.399" style="s2">sometimes a man wants to marry a mom,</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.279" end="00:10:52.079" style="s2">but he doesn&#39;t want her kid. He already</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.399" end="00:10:54.079" style="s2">has Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.079" end="00:10:56.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, look at me. If I marry your mom,</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.079" end="00:10:59.600" style="s2">then you and Theo will both be my</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.399" end="00:11:02.160" style="s2">children. You want me to stay, too?</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.600" end="00:11:04.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. If the place is too small, we</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.160" end="00:11:07.200" style="s2">can move somewhere bigger together. But</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.959" end="00:11:09.519" style="s2">no one in our family gets left out.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.200" end="00:11:11.760" style="s2">Let&#39;s draw it again.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.519" end="00:11:14.480" style="s2">This time, put yourself right next to</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.760" end="00:11:17.279" style="s2">mom. Okay,</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.480" end="00:11:22.399" style="s2">Theo, come help out. Make the dinner</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.279" end="00:11:25.279" style="s2">table bigger so it fits all four of us.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.399" end="00:11:28.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to sit next to Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.279" end="00:11:32.240" style="s2">I&#39;ll draw a race car for you here, your</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.959" end="00:11:35.279" style="s2">favorite. Then I&#39;ll draw a little bunny</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.240" end="00:11:37.680" style="s2">for you right by your bed.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.279" end="00:11:38.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to come home and see both kids</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.680" end="00:11:41.040" style="s2">smiling.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.399" end="00:11:46.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.040" end="00:11:46.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, how about we get married today?</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.519" end="00:11:50.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you both confirm that you are</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.959" end="00:11:51.920" style="s2">entering into this marriage of your own</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.560" end="00:11:52.800" style="s2">free will?</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.920" end="00:11:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.800" end="00:11:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.040" end="00:12:02.240" style="s2">Congratulations to you both.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.040" end="00:12:06.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I call you mommy now?</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.240" end="00:12:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you can. Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.079" end="00:12:09.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let mommy give you a hug.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.920" end="00:12:12.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.839" end="00:12:12.839" style="s2">Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.959" end="00:12:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I left the house this morning, I</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.720" end="00:12:16.560" style="s2">never thought I&#39;d end up getting married</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.000" end="00:12:20.440" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.560" end="00:12:20.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like they chose well.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.040" end="00:12:37.920" style="s2">So, the godfather is a woman. No wonder</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.000" end="00:12:39.920" style="s2">we could never track her down. She even</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.920" end="00:12:42.320" style="s2">managed to hide her gender.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.920" end="00:12:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. Nightingale, I finally have a</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.320" end="00:12:46.160" style="s2">lead on you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.480" end="00:12:48.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you got some good news, too?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.160" end="00:12:50.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. An old debt that&#39;s been dragging</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.399" end="00:12:51.920" style="s2">on for far too long is finally about to</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.959" end="00:12:54.560" style="s2">be settled.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.920" end="00:12:56.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today just keeps getting better. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.560" end="00:12:57.920" style="s2">finally going to</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.160" end="00:13:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; catch you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.920" end="00:13:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, remember our deal? Yeah. You go</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.680" end="00:13:06.720" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.000" end="00:13:10.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two plotting now?</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.720" end="00:13:12.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re sleeping together tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.320" end="00:13:14.560" style="s2">We already picked our sides and we won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.639" end="00:13:17.760" style="s2">fight over the blanket.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.560" end="00:13:19.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, fine by us.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.760" end="00:13:21.040" style="s2">And [snorts] mom and dad have to sleep</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.680" end="00:13:22.959" style="s2">together, too.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.040" end="00:13:24.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We sleep together and you sleep</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.959" end="00:13:27.880" style="s2">together. Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.639" end="00:13:27.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.480" end="00:13:35.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you two already married?</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.720" end="00:13:39.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of of course we&#39;re married. It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.120" end="00:13:39.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; then you have to sleep together.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.120" end="00:13:47.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night, Dad. Good night, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.000" end="00:13:57.320" style="s2">You take the side by the wall. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.760" end="00:13:57.320" style="s2">sleep on the edge.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.680" end="00:14:03.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. He&#39;s keeping his distance. Does he</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.880" end="00:14:05.199" style="s2">really hate being close to me that much?</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.680" end="00:14:07.120" style="s2">I have a lead on the Godfather&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.199" end="00:14:07.680" style="s2">whereabouts. I need to go confirm it</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.120" end="00:14:09.680" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.680" end="00:14:14.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to go see what Luca found out.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.680" end="00:14:14.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait until she falls asleep first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.760" end="00:14:21.560" style="s2">Audrey, are you asleep?</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.480" end="00:14:29.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante,</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.519" end="00:14:29.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; how is she still awake?</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.680" end="00:14:32.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you asleep?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.814" end="00:14:35.760" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.800" end="00:14:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante,</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.760" end="00:14:40.920" style="s2">looks like working night shifts really</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.440" end="00:14:40.920" style="s2">wore him out.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.000" end="00:15:00.199" style="s2">I thought you were asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.320" end="00:15:00.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going this late?</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.399" end="00:15:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An urgent debt came up. I have to go</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.320" end="00:15:06.480" style="s2">take care of it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.320" end="00:15:07.440" style="s2">What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.480" end="00:15:09.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Night shift.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.440" end="00:15:10.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That must be tough. But take care of</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.199" end="00:15:11.040" style="s2">yourself and don&#39;t push yourself too</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.639" end="00:15:12.959" style="s2">hard.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.040" end="00:15:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too. If you can&#39;t collect, find</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.959" end="00:15:15.360" style="s2">another way. Don&#39;t put yourself in</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.560" end="00:15:18.240" style="s2">danger over it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.360" end="00:15:19.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I know what I&#39;m doing.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.240" end="00:15:24.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me if anything happens.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.760" end="00:15:24.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Don&#39;t stay out too late.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.455" end="00:15:32.800" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.880" end="00:15:34.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neringuel, there&#39;s a new opportunity to</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.800" end="00:15:36.000" style="s2">go undercover in the Melli family. It</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.800" end="00:15:38.720" style="s2">could give you access to their core</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.000" end="00:15:40.639" style="s2">members.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.720" end="00:15:43.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send me the details. I need to prepare</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.639" end="00:15:45.360" style="s2">thoroughly for this job.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.199" end="00:15:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.360" end="00:15:49.199" style="s2">any progress on Nightingale&#39;s identity?</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.440" end="00:15:50.560" style="s2">Aside from confirming she&#39;s a woman, we</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.199" end="00:15:51.680" style="s2">don&#39;t have any other leads yet. Things</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.560" end="00:15:54.720" style="s2">would be much easier if we could</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.680" end="00:15:58.320" style="s2">infiltrate the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.720" end="00:16:00.000" style="s2">Fine, then I&#39;ll infiltrate it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.320" end="00:16:01.519" style="s2">Their vetting process is extremely</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.000" end="00:16:04.079" style="s2">strict. We can&#39;t recklessly send our</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.519" end="00:16:07.279" style="s2">people in, let alone you. No, my wife</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.079" end="00:16:10.000" style="s2">already got me in. Wife? You got</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.279" end="00:16:12.399" style="s2">married? That&#39;s right. I&#39;m married.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.000" end="00:16:14.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t make a fuss. Then should we tell</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.399" end="00:16:16.959" style="s2">Mrs. Melia?</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.800" end="00:16:18.720" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.959" end="00:16:20.560" style="s2">The moment she shows up, everything will</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.720" end="00:16:22.959" style="s2">be blown. Does your wife still not know</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.560" end="00:16:25.360" style="s2">who you really are? She thinks I&#39;m just</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.959" end="00:16:29.480" style="s2">an ordinary security guard. Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.360" end="00:16:29.480" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell everyone to watch themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.199" end="00:16:37.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ID, forms, everything&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.600" end="00:16:39.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for setting all of this up for</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.040" end="00:16:40.800" style="s2">me. I&#39;m just glad you agreed to come. I</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.360" end="00:16:42.800" style="s2">thought you&#39;d be too proud to accept my</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.800" end="00:16:44.959" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.800" end="00:16:46.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, I&#39;ll be home earlier and</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.959" end="00:16:46.880" style="s2">I&#39;ll cook dinner for all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.091" end="00:16:48.240" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.880" end="00:16:51.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, the kids and I will hold you to</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.240" end="00:16:51.240" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.920" end="00:16:56.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nergale, this time I&#39;m coming in to hunt</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.240" end="00:17:00.079" style="s2">you down myself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.560" end="00:17:02.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please sign right here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.079" end="00:17:04.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, I managed to do something for</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.079" end="00:17:05.839" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.160" end="00:17:08.839" style="s2">Boss, those files you asked for last</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.839" end="00:17:08.839" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.319" end="00:17:14.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.319" end="00:17:17.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; he&#39;s the officer whose debt my team was</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.079" end="00:17:18.400" style="s2">collecting. That&#39;s why he calls me boss.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.039" end="00:17:19.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Here to bring me an application</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.400" end="00:17:21.520" style="s2">for a payment extension?</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.839" end="00:17:23.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. It&#39;s what you asked for last</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.520" end="00:17:25.439" style="s2">night. All sorted out.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.839" end="00:17:27.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let it happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.439" end="00:17:31.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I was right yesterday. You</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.439" end="00:17:33.840" style="s2">really are cut out to lead a team.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.679" end="00:17:36.320" style="s2">Dante, follow me. I&#39;ll show you around</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.840" end="00:17:38.000" style="s2">your post. Go ahead, then. I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.320" end="00:17:39.679" style="s2">these old debts to settle, too.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.000" end="00:17:43.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get to it. I&#39;ve already taken up enough</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.679" end="00:17:43.080" style="s2">of your time today.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.799" end="00:17:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the conference area. Keep an eye</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.640" end="00:17:50.160" style="s2">on the hallway during your rounds and</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.000" end="00:17:52.240" style="s2">report anything unusual right away.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.160" end="00:17:53.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.240" end="00:17:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go grab the duty schedule. Get</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.760" end="00:17:57.520" style="s2">familiar with the area first.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.520" end="00:18:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.520" end="00:18:04.679" style="s2">Nethergale task force. Is she in there?</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.320" end="00:18:04.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nethergill is here. Let&#39;s get started.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.720" end="00:18:12.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are the files Nightingale had me</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.320" end="00:18:15.520" style="s2">bring over. She&#39;s joining via secure</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.160" end="00:18:17.600" style="s2">line and the connection is up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.520" end="00:18:22.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Won&#39;t even show her face for a meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.600" end="00:18:22.440" style="s2">Cautious as ever. Can&#39;t hear clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.600" end="00:18:27.240" style="s2">She&#39;s messing her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.679" end="00:18:37.880" style="s2">Is this where she&#39;s headed next?</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.440" end="00:18:44.080" style="s2">I left something inside.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.559" end="00:18:47.080" style="s2">I left something inside.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.080" end="00:18:47.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.480" end="00:18:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, what are you doing in here?</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.400" end="00:18:56.400" style="s2">Someone put in a maintenance call saying</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.840" end="00:18:58.640" style="s2">this outlet was loose. Came in to check</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.400" end="00:19:02.440" style="s2">it out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.640" end="00:19:02.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left something inside.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.400" end="00:19:11.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe the cops left these</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.840" end="00:19:13.600" style="s2">files sitting out where two outsiders</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.919" end="00:19:15.039" style="s2">could see them.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.600" end="00:19:15.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not like I&#39;d understand any of it</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.039" end="00:19:17.039" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.679" end="00:19:18.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t done your orientation yet,</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.039" end="00:19:20.018" style="s2">right? I&#39;ll come with you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.480" end="00:19:22.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orientation?</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.018" end="00:19:24.400" style="s2">[snorts] What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.320" end="00:19:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I solemnly swear to uphold the law and</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.400" end="00:19:28.320" style="s2">faithfully perform my duties. I solemnly</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.480" end="00:19:32.080" style="s2">swear to uphold the law and faithfully</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.320" end="00:19:33.760" style="s2">perform my duties. Me, a mafia boss,</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.080" end="00:19:35.679" style="s2">swearing to obey the law in front of a</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.760" end="00:19:37.679" style="s2">badge. To assist law enforcement and</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.679" end="00:19:39.919" style="s2">maintain public order. To assist law</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.679" end="00:19:42.400" style="s2">enforcement and maintain public order.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.919" end="00:19:44.240" style="s2">And never to harbor or abade criminal</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.400" end="00:19:46.218" style="s2">activity.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.240" end="00:19:47.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And never.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.218" end="00:19:50.960" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.600" end="00:19:50.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be nervous.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.679" end="00:19:58.480" style="s2">and never to harbor or abade criminal</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.679" end="00:20:00.480" style="s2">activity. That&#39;s it. Welcome aboard.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.480" end="00:20:04.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. You&#39;re practically an</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.480" end="00:20:04.280" style="s2">honorary cop. Now</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.880" end="00:20:10.320" style="s2">there, now you actually look ready for</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.720" end="00:20:13.039" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.320" end="00:20:15.039" style="s2">I have to head out. But promise me, if</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.039" end="00:20:16.799" style="s2">anything goes down here, don&#39;t play the</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.039" end="00:20:19.120" style="s2">hero. You&#39;re just a security guard. Let</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.799" end="00:20:20.720" style="s2">the cops handle the danger.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.120" end="00:20:22.480" style="s2">that worried about me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.720" end="00:20:26.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I am. The kids are waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.480" end="00:20:27.200" style="s2">you at home and so am I. You hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.160" end="00:20:29.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.200" end="00:20:30.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She genuinely cares about me while all</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.280" end="00:20:32.000" style="s2">I&#39;m doing is using her to track down</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.799" end="00:20:34.880" style="s2">Nightingale.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.000" end="00:20:39.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same goes for you. Don&#39;t be reckless.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.880" end="00:20:39.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. [music] See you tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.960" end="00:20:43.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one from the collection</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.240" end="00:20:46.679" style="s2">agency.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.360" end="00:20:46.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.280" end="00:20:50.000" style="s2">Reception.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.000" end="00:20:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Godfather is arriving shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.000" end="00:20:53.919" style="s2">Everyone be ready to welcome him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.520" end="00:20:57.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. Right away.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.919" end="00:20:59.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Godfather is coming.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.679" end="00:21:02.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your matter will have to wait. Just stay</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.360" end="00:21:04.240" style="s2">put right here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.799" end="00:21:05.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can help tidy things up in the</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.240" end="00:21:07.120" style="s2">meantime.</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.039" end="00:21:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Set out the tea set and don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.120" end="00:21:12.440" style="s2">wander off.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.120" end="00:21:12.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll do.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.039" end="00:21:21.480" style="s2">Will the Godfather pass through here?</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.559" end="00:21:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologies for calling you back on short</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.080" end="00:21:37.480" style="s2">notice, sir, but this document requires</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.000" end="00:21:37.480" style="s2">your personal signature.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.320" end="00:21:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me what needs my approval. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.400" end="00:21:46.080" style="s2">sign it and leave. Also, the new hire</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.480" end="00:21:47.520" style="s2">has arrived. The manager has her waiting</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.080" end="00:21:49.840" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.520" end="00:21:53.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That man, why does his build look so</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.840" end="00:21:53.159" style="s2">much like Dante?</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.360" end="00:22:05.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Romano, this is Mr. Luca Romano. He</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.400" end="00:22:07.120" style="s2">handles affairs here on behalf of the</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.919" end="00:22:09.039" style="s2">boss.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.120" end="00:22:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, he&#39;s just the boss&#39;s proxy. Was I</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.039" end="00:22:11.679" style="s2">seeing things earlier? Just handle the</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.480" end="00:22:14.679" style="s2">new and Lloyd by the book. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.679" end="00:22:14.679" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.559" end="00:22:22.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing they kept me here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.720" end="00:22:25.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that all?</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.679" end="00:22:29.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, everything has been taken care of.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.840" end="00:22:29.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.679" end="00:22:38.280" style="s2">Where&#39;s the car? This way.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.760" end="00:22:44.760" style="s2">Dante,</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.440" end="00:22:55.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sir, this way.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.760" end="00:22:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop right there. New recruits aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.400" end="00:23:01.200" style="s2">allowed to act on their own.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.840" end="00:23:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I saw someone I knew. I just</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.200" end="00:23:03.120" style="s2">wanted to check.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.000" end="00:23:05.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;d better pray you were</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.120" end="00:23:07.039" style="s2">mistaken. Otherwise, I&#39;ll have reason to</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.039" end="00:23:08.799" style="s2">suspect both of you are undercover. I</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.039" end="00:23:10.880" style="s2">only caught a glimpse of his profile.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.799" end="00:23:12.720" style="s2">Maybe he just looks like him. Dante is</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.880" end="00:23:14.080" style="s2">still working at the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.720" end="00:23:17.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.080" end="00:23:17.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.960" end="00:23:28.360" style="s2">Get in line.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.200" end="00:23:35.640" style="s2">Before you stay, you&#39;ll swear your</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.640" end="00:23:35.640" style="s2">loyalty.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.400" end="00:23:42.640" style="s2">Be loyal to the family. Keep it secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.559" end="00:23:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be loyal to the family. Keep it secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.640" end="00:23:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never provide inside information to the</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.320" end="00:23:46.880" style="s2">police.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.960" end="00:23:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never provide inside information to the</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.880" end="00:23:49.120" style="s2">police.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.440" end="00:23:51.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uphold the law. Fight crime.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.120" end="00:23:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uphold the law. Fight crime.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.679" end="00:23:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never help the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.840" end="00:23:57.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never help the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.760" end="00:23:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.200" end="00:24:02.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finish the line.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.320" end="00:24:02.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never help the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.531" end="00:24:11.551" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.960" end="00:24:26.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Undercover work is so damn hard.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.240" end="00:24:36.080" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you say anything when you</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.520" end="00:24:37.600" style="s2">came in?</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.080" end="00:24:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you climb into bed without even</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.600" end="00:24:39.600" style="s2">looking?</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.000" end="00:24:43.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you weren&#39;t home yet.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.600" end="00:24:43.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you weren&#39;t home yet either.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.240" end="00:24:50.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Mom, what just happened?</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.400" end="00:24:51.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, nothing. We were just looking for</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.320" end="00:24:52.880" style="s2">something,</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.039" end="00:24:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; right? Looking for something.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.880" end="00:24:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I heard you fighting. Don&#39;t you want</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.120" end="00:24:59.200" style="s2">to live together anymore? No, sweetie.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.000" end="00:25:01.600" style="s2">We weren&#39;t fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.200" end="00:25:03.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then can you both stay with us tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.600" end="00:25:05.600" style="s2">please?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.279" end="00:25:07.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, we&#39;ll both stay with you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.600" end="00:25:10.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then read us a story together. Neither</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.360" end="00:25:10.840" style="s2">of you can leave.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.520" end="00:25:16.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The two little bears finally had a home</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.840" end="00:25:18.480" style="s2">of their own. Every night before bed,</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.880" end="00:25:19.600" style="s2">their mom and dad would be right by</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.480" end="00:25:22.000" style="s2">their side.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.600" end="00:25:26.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just like us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.000" end="00:25:26.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Just like us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.840" end="00:25:33.600" style="s2">You take the bed. I&#39;ll sleep on the</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.520" end="00:25:35.919" style="s2">couch.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.600" end="00:25:38.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t keep doing this. Tonight, we</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.919" end="00:25:41.960" style="s2">have to sleep together.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.640" end="00:25:41.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have to.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.640" end="00:25:47.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want the kids worrying that we</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.880" end="00:25:48.799" style="s2">could split up at any moment. Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.279" end="00:25:50.240" style="s2">we can&#39;t keep taking turns sleeping on</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.799" end="00:25:53.520" style="s2">the couch every other night.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.240" end="00:25:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, just sleep in the same bed? We have</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.520" end="00:25:59.240" style="s2">to get used to it sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.240" end="00:25:59.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.559" end="00:26:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.840" end="00:26:10.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.400" end="00:26:13.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just trying to pull the blanket.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.159" end="00:26:15.348" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.328" end="00:26:15.348" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.400" end="00:26:19.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve dealt with so many difficult</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.919" end="00:26:21.440" style="s2">people, yet I don&#39;t even know how to act</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.760" end="00:26:23.039" style="s2">around my own husband. At least neither</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.440" end="00:26:24.480" style="s2">of us screamed this time.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.039" end="00:26:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t bring that up again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.480" end="00:26:30.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, the thing I looked forward to</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.000" end="00:26:30.600" style="s2">most today was coming home to you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.480" end="00:26:36.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I kiss you?</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.520" end="00:26:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.279" end="00:26:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you that nervous?</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.880" end="00:26:46.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m usually not this clumsy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.880" end="00:26:49.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it here. You won&#39;t bump into</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.240" end="00:26:49.240" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.840" end="00:26:54.080" style="s2">Luca, get the kids some everyday things.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.840" end="00:26:55.520" style="s2">Toothbrushes, towels, cups, two of</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.080" end="00:26:56.960" style="s2">everything. Theo and Lily should have</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.520" end="00:26:59.840" style="s2">the same things. Don&#39;t just focus on</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.960" end="00:27:01.279" style="s2">Theo.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.840" end="00:27:03.279" style="s2">And don&#39;t bring anything with the family</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.279" end="00:27:05.520" style="s2">crest on it. Use plain packaging.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.279" end="00:27:07.360" style="s2">Understood. Two of each, matching sets.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.520" end="00:27:10.159" style="s2">No family insignia.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.360" end="00:27:11.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two of each. Why would Theo suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.159" end="00:27:13.520" style="s2">need two sets of everything?</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.760" end="00:27:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo made a new friend. They&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.520" end="00:27:16.640" style="s2">spending a lot of time together, so Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.200" end="00:27:18.799" style="s2">Moretti wanted an extra set of</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.640" end="00:27:21.520" style="s2">everything. Just a playmate, yet they</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.799" end="00:27:23.200" style="s2">need dedicated toothbrushes and towels.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.520" end="00:27:23.919" style="s2">Luca, do you really think you can fool</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.200" end="00:27:26.000" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.919" end="00:27:27.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She lives in the apartment, too. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.000" end="00:27:30.400" style="s2">She&#39;s [snorts] Mrs. Moretti&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.679" end="00:27:35.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Moretti? Since when does Dante have</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.400" end="00:27:35.320" style="s2">a wife? Call him back here this instant.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.080" end="00:27:38.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got married?</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.840" end="00:27:41.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luca told you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.880" end="00:27:45.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking you. Did you or didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.120" end="00:27:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. Her name is Audrey.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.120" end="00:27:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring her over. I want to meet her.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.960" end="00:27:50.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, wait. She only knows me as a</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.960" end="00:27:52.799" style="s2">security guard.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.960" end="00:27:54.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A security guard?</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.799" end="00:27:55.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t found the right time to tell</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.159" end="00:27:57.440" style="s2">her the truth. She and her daughter just</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.840" end="00:27:59.120" style="s2">settled down. I don&#39;t want you showing</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.440" end="00:28:00.960" style="s2">up out of nowhere with an entourage and</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.120" end="00:28:03.120" style="s2">disrupting their lives.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.960" end="00:28:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re quite protective of her. What</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.120" end="00:28:08.720" style="s2">about Theo? Is he okay with this?</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.320" end="00:28:12.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He already calls her mom.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.720" end="00:28:16.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I won&#39;t see her just yet.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.960" end="00:28:16.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.279" end="00:28:23.360" style="s2">If Theo&#39;s already calling her mom, I</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.760" end="00:28:25.440" style="s2">need to meet this woman more than ever.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.360" end="00:28:28.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop that for now. Go receive a VIP</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.440" end="00:28:28.440" style="s2">guest.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.200" end="00:28:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need you to look into someone for me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.279" end="00:28:38.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her, the Godfather from the photo.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.480" end="00:28:40.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you to investigate a woman named</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.240" end="00:28:45.600" style="s2">Audrey.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.799" end="00:28:45.600" style="s2">Take a seat. I have a task for you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.480" end="00:28:50.080" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.760" end="00:28:51.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you used to collect debts, so</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.080" end="00:28:55.440" style="s2">tracking people down and digging into</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.679" end="00:28:57.440" style="s2">their past shouldn&#39;t be new to you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.440" end="00:28:59.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you to investigate a woman named</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.440" end="00:29:01.679" style="s2">Audrey. She has a daughter and recently</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.919" end="00:29:04.000" style="s2">got married. Why do you want to look</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.679" end="00:29:07.720" style="s2">into her? Did she do something?</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.000" end="00:29:07.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s none of your concern.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.480" end="00:29:12.640" style="s2">I need to know everything about her</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.080" end="00:29:14.080" style="s2">family, whether she was married before</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.640" end="00:29:14.960" style="s2">and what her current marriage looks</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.080" end="00:29:16.640" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.960" end="00:29:19.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even her family.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.640" end="00:29:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, she&#39;s already traced my</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.120" end="00:29:24.320" style="s2">family. Is she saying this just to test</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.520" end="00:29:25.600" style="s2">my reaction? What if they&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.320" end="00:29:28.880" style="s2">ordinary people?</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.600" end="00:29:31.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure they&#39;re not.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.880" end="00:29:34.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t push any further. If I do,</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.600" end="00:29:38.000" style="s2">she&#39;ll see what I&#39;m afraid of.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.640" end="00:29:39.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t go mentioning this to anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.000" end="00:29:41.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.440" end="00:29:42.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very good. I&#39;ll be waiting for your</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.760" end="00:29:45.279" style="s2">update.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.559" end="00:29:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much does she actually know? Are</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.279" end="00:29:49.039" style="s2">Donto and the kids already being</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.799" end="00:29:51.120" style="s2">targeted?</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.039" end="00:29:52.240" style="s2">Once you find this woman, how do you</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.120" end="00:29:55.279" style="s2">plan to handle her?</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.240" end="00:29:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet her first. As for her future, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.279" end="00:29:59.840" style="s2">arrange it personally. My son hid his</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.600" end="00:30:02.559" style="s2">identity to marry her. I can&#39;t just let</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.840" end="00:30:05.440" style="s2">the mother and daughter suffer with him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.559" end="00:30:07.520" style="s2">arrange it. She&#39;s going to deal with me</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.440" end="00:30:10.000" style="s2">personally. What if she just wants a</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.520" end="00:30:13.440" style="s2">quiet life with her husband and kids?</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.000" end="00:30:14.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That would be ideal, of course. Still,</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.440" end="00:30:17.039" style="s2">it depends on whether she can keep</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.960" end="00:30:19.520" style="s2">secrets that shouldn&#39;t get out. After</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.039" end="00:30:22.159" style="s2">all, if she can&#39;t keep Dante&#39;s real</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.520" end="00:30:23.600" style="s2">identity under wrap, her life won&#39;t stay</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.159" end="00:30:26.080" style="s2">peaceful for long.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.600" end="00:30:28.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, if I blow her cover, she won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.080" end="00:30:31.200" style="s2">me off. Just how much does she know</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.720" end="00:30:33.440" style="s2">already? You&#39;ve done collections, so you</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.200" end="00:30:34.799" style="s2">know how this works. I&#39;m trusting you</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.440" end="00:30:35.520" style="s2">with this because I don&#39;t want to make a</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.799" end="00:30:37.760" style="s2">scene.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.520" end="00:30:38.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. No one else will hear</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.760" end="00:30:40.720" style="s2">about it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.559" end="00:30:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Once you have the full picture,</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.720" end="00:30:45.720" style="s2">come to me first. I&#39;ll meet her in</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.720" end="00:30:45.720" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.000" end="00:30:50.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I&#39;ll go take care of my stuff</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.360" end="00:30:50.360" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.240" end="00:30:58.640" style="s2">My cover might be blown. They&#39;re looking</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.080" end="00:31:00.159" style="s2">into my family.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.640" end="00:31:02.080" style="s2">She ordered me to dig into my own</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.159" end="00:31:04.080" style="s2">identity and specifically asked about my</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.080" end="00:31:05.840" style="s2">husband and kids.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.080" end="00:31:08.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you need an extraction?</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.840" end="00:31:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pulling out now would only tip her off.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.320" end="00:31:12.000" style="s2">Request protection from my family first.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.240" end="00:31:14.080" style="s2">I&#39;ll go home and talk to my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.000" end="00:31:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. Reach out immediately if</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.080" end="00:31:18.520" style="s2">anything changes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.200" end="00:31:18.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Copy that.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.840" end="00:31:29.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, gentle. You&#39;re hurting Bunny.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.600" end="00:31:31.360" style="s2">Mom, you&#39;re back. We saved dinner for</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.600" end="00:31:34.080" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.360" end="00:31:36.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All done. See if it&#39;s dirty now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.080" end="00:31:39.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, look. Daddy fixed it. Now Bunny</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.320" end="00:31:41.440" style="s2">can sleep with me again.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.600" end="00:31:43.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything happens to them because of</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.440" end="00:31:47.159" style="s2">my mission, I&#39;ll be the one who destroys</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.919" end="00:31:47.159" style="s2">this family.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.440" end="00:31:50.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.039" end="00:31:54.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo. Lily, go play in your room for a</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.960" end="00:31:54.919" style="s2">bit. Mommy and I need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.600" end="00:31:58.799" style="s2">What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.640" end="00:32:00.482" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.799" end="00:32:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to carry this alone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.482" end="00:32:04.559" style="s2">[music] Whatever it is, tell me. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.720" end="00:32:06.377" style="s2">figure it out together.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.559" end="00:32:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if this puts all of you in danger?</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.377" end="00:32:08.640" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.640" end="00:32:10.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the more reason to tell me. We&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.640" end="00:32:11.919" style="s2">family now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.960" end="00:32:12.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s [snorts] something I have to</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.919" end="00:32:15.679" style="s2">tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.799" end="00:32:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have something to tell you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.679" end="00:32:20.840" style="s2">Actually,</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.840" end="00:32:20.840" style="s2">I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.480" end="00:32:26.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The truth is my job is much more</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.640" end="00:32:28.960" style="s2">dangerous than I let on. It could put</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.320" end="00:32:30.159" style="s2">you and the kids at risk.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.960" end="00:32:30.640" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I should have told you</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.159" end="00:32:32.080" style="s2">sooner.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.640" end="00:32:34.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, I haven&#39;t been completely honest</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.080" end="00:32:35.440" style="s2">with you either. When we first met, I</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.159" end="00:32:37.360" style="s2">hid some things from you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.440" end="00:32:39.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what you said that day?</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.360" end="00:32:42.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some of it wasn&#39;t true.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.679" end="00:32:43.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Later, I wanted to tell you, but the</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.159" end="00:32:47.120" style="s2">more I cared, the harder it was to find</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.679" end="00:32:48.480" style="s2">the words. Me, too. Every time I wanted</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.120" end="00:32:51.200" style="s2">to tell you, I was terrified nothing</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.480" end="00:32:52.559" style="s2">between us would ever be the same. Then,</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.200" end="00:32:54.960" style="s2">let&#39;s lay everything on the table</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.559" end="00:32:57.679" style="s2">tonight. No more lying to each other</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.960" end="00:33:00.679" style="s2">from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.679" end="00:33:00.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.840" end="00:33:08.840" style="s2">Actually,</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.159" end="00:33:17.159" style="s2">I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.039" end="00:33:28.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.120" end="00:33:35.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.640" end="00:33:39.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t help myself. My son got</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.279" end="00:33:39.880" style="s2">married. I had to meet his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.600" end="00:33:49.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, I&#39;ll play along.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.523" end="00:33:52.543" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.360" end="00:33:57.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, who&#39;s at the door?</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.320" end="00:34:02.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my former employer from when I did</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.320" end="00:34:05.279" style="s2">security work. She stopped by to see how</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.399" end="00:34:05.279" style="s2">I&#39;m doing.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.240" end="00:34:14.079" style="s2">This is Audrey, [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.359" end="00:34:18.320" style="s2">my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.079" end="00:34:22.599" style="s2">Audrey is my son&#39;s wife. I hired my own</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.320" end="00:34:22.599" style="s2">daughter-in-law to investigate herself.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.040" end="00:34:29.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. Dante used to work for me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.919" end="00:34:32.079" style="s2">I had no idea you were his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.200" end="00:34:35.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her. The Godfather just showed up</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.079" end="00:34:35.639" style="s2">at my front door.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.520" end="00:34:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Aren&#39;t you going to invite me in?</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.000" end="00:34:43.440" style="s2">I can&#39;t do anything reckless in front of</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.520" end="00:34:44.720" style="s2">the kids. I need to figure out what she</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.440" end="00:34:49.639" style="s2">wants first.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.720" end="00:34:49.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Please take a seat.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.200" end="00:34:55.280" style="s2">Why did you come by so suddenly? Is this</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.119" end="00:34:57.520" style="s2">about work? Dante worked for me for</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.280" end="00:34:59.839" style="s2">years. When he suddenly got married, I</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.520" end="00:35:01.440" style="s2">had to see for myself. How are you two</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.839" end="00:35:03.520" style="s2">settling into married life?</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.440" end="00:35:05.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really well. Audrey helped me land a new</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.520" end="00:35:08.960" style="s2">security job. The hours are steady, so I</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.760" end="00:35:12.000" style="s2">get to spend more time with the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.960" end="00:35:15.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know that lady out there?</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.000" end="00:35:15.640" style="s2">She&#39;s my grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.280" end="00:35:22.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But dad said I can&#39;t call her grandma</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.280" end="00:35:22.520" style="s2">for now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.880" end="00:35:30.079" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep your secret. I won&#39;t call her</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.280" end="00:35:30.079" style="s2">that either, and I won&#39;t tell anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.839" end="00:35:39.560" style="s2">Kids, come over here. Look, I brought</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.160" end="00:35:39.560" style="s2">you some gifts.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.240" end="00:35:47.280" style="s2">This is for you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.480" end="00:35:51.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A race car.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.280" end="00:35:51.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this one&#39;s for you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.800" end="00:35:56.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.640" end="00:36:06.240" style="s2">You certainly did your research on our</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.240" end="00:36:08.160" style="s2">family, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.240" end="00:36:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante mentioned what the children like,</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.160" end="00:36:13.359" style="s2">so I picked these out based on that.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.040" end="00:36:15.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. When I worked for her, I talked</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.359" end="00:36:16.640" style="s2">about the kids all the time. I even</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.280" end="00:36:17.839" style="s2">brought Lily up to her a couple of days</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.640" end="00:36:19.680" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.839" end="00:36:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It seems she knows far more than I gave</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.680" end="00:36:25.520" style="s2">her credit for.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.720" end="00:36:28.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s eat first. Kids, go put your gifts</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.520" end="00:36:28.520" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.400" end="00:36:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, if you don&#39;t mind me asking,</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.640" end="00:36:40.320" style="s2">Dante has a child of his own, and his</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.560" end="00:36:41.200" style="s2">income isn&#39;t very high. Do you really</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.320" end="00:36:42.160" style="s2">not mind?</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.200" end="00:36:43.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, we already</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.160" end="00:36:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we talked all of that through before we</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.440" end="00:36:49.280" style="s2">got married. Theo is my child, and Lily</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.920" end="00:36:50.880" style="s2">is his. Neither child is baggage.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.280" end="00:36:51.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But on what he makes now, won&#39;t it be</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.880" end="00:36:53.680" style="s2">hard on you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.599" end="00:36:55.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I work, too. We&#39;ll handle the bills</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.680" end="00:36:59.000" style="s2">together. And I see everything he does</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.599" end="00:36:59.000" style="s2">for this family.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.839" end="00:37:07.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I shouldn&#39;t have pried.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.715" end="00:37:07.735" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.079" end="00:37:13.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two stay here. I&#39;ll take the kids to</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.000" end="00:37:13.160" style="s2">their room.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.920" end="00:37:28.720" style="s2">Now that your husband isn&#39;t here, we can</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.760" end="00:37:30.079" style="s2">speak plainly.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.720" end="00:37:32.000" style="s2">Before you say anything, I want to make</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.079" end="00:37:36.200" style="s2">one thing clear. Neither my husband nor</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.000" end="00:37:36.200" style="s2">the children know what I actually do.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.280" end="00:37:42.520" style="s2">If you have a problem, come to me and</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.960" end="00:37:42.520" style="s2">leave them out of it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.599" end="00:37:49.200" style="s2">Are you worried I&#39;ll make things</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.800" end="00:37:50.640" style="s2">difficult for Dante?</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.200" end="00:37:53.599" style="s2">I&#39;m not going to make things difficult</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.640" end="00:37:56.560" style="s2">for him. Relax. I just need to know one</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.599" end="00:37:57.599" style="s2">thing. Do you truly love him?</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.560" end="00:38:00.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Real?</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.599" end="00:38:00.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.760" end="00:38:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly do you mean by that?</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.520" end="00:38:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante rarely trusts anyone like this. I</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.160" end="00:38:11.119" style="s2">don&#39;t want him to get hurt, especially</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.079" end="00:38:12.720" style="s2">not by the person he trusts most.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.119" end="00:38:15.720" style="s2">Hearing you say that puts my mind at</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.720" end="00:38:15.720" style="s2">ease.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.720" end="00:38:27.280" style="s2">Then when can I expect your report on</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.720" end="00:38:30.000" style="s2">that woman?</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.280" end="00:38:31.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still need a little more time.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.000" end="00:38:33.920" style="s2">Take your time. Look into her</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.920" end="00:38:36.000" style="s2">thoroughly. I&#39;m curious to see what your</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.920" end="00:38:38.400" style="s2">assessment of her will be. Having her</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.000" end="00:38:41.720" style="s2">investigate herself. I wonder how she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.400" end="00:38:41.720" style="s2">describe herself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.040" end="00:38:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.040" end="00:38:48.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. And we were just discussing</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.400" end="00:38:49.839" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.240" end="00:38:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s already late. Whatever work it is,</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.839" end="00:38:57.079" style="s2">it can wait. I&#39;ll walk you downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.880" end="00:38:57.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re not finished talking yet.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.440" end="00:39:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t we agree to wait until I set</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.960" end="00:39:02.320" style="s2">things up? Showing up out of nowhere</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.720" end="00:39:03.920" style="s2">gave me zero time to prepare.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.320" end="00:39:05.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not like I blew our cover.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.920" end="00:39:09.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what were you two talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.680" end="00:39:10.960" style="s2">She looked rattled when you came out.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.359" end="00:39:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was worried her job might affect</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.960" end="00:39:15.119" style="s2">you. Terrified I&#39;d give you a hard time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.440" end="00:39:15.599" style="s2">You really found yourself a keeper this</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.119" end="00:39:18.839" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.599" end="00:39:18.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.720" end="00:39:26.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me before you come next time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.640" end="00:39:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She found out where I live. My husband</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.720" end="00:39:31.440" style="s2">used to work for her.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.599" end="00:39:33.200" style="s2">I need to verify Isabella and Dante&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.440" end="00:39:34.960" style="s2">professional relationship. Find out what</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.200" end="00:39:36.400" style="s2">he used to do for her. And please push</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.960" end="00:39:38.480" style="s2">the request for protection for my family</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.400" end="00:39:39.920" style="s2">through as soon as possible. Until I</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.480" end="00:39:44.079" style="s2">know how they&#39;re connected, I can&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.920" end="00:39:44.079" style="s2">my family get dragged into this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.800" end="00:39:51.280" style="s2">Not asleep yet?</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.440" end="00:39:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Isabella treat you well back then?</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.280" end="00:39:55.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty well. Why the sudden question?</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.520" end="00:39:58.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You worked for her for so long. Did she</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.680" end="00:39:59.680" style="s2">ever make you do anything dangerous or</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.160" end="00:40:01.280" style="s2">force you to do things you clearly</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.680" end="00:40:02.560" style="s2">didn&#39;t want to do?</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.280" end="00:40:04.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you worried she pushed me around</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.560" end="00:40:06.800" style="s2">back then?</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.079" end="00:40:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, nothing like that. It was just basic</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.800" end="00:40:11.960" style="s2">security work and she always paid me on</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.960" end="00:40:11.960" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.880" end="00:40:16.640" style="s2">You defended me plenty today. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.720" end="00:40:18.000" style="s2">worry. She never mistreated me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.640" end="00:40:19.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How am I supposed to tell him that I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.000" end="00:40:20.960" style="s2">investigating his former boss?</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.440" end="00:40:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you still frowning?</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.960" end="00:40:24.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just don&#39;t want anything happening to</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.200" end="00:40:26.480" style="s2">you or the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.480" end="00:40:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but that&#39;s not what&#39;s important</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.480" end="00:40:31.880" style="s2">right now. Audrey, what were you going</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.480" end="00:40:31.880" style="s2">to tell me earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.400" end="00:40:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why don&#39;t you go first? Didn&#39;t you have</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.240" end="00:40:39.839" style="s2">something to tell me, too?</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.440" end="00:40:41.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think you should go first. What were</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.839" end="00:40:43.359" style="s2">you going to say?</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.119" end="00:40:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. I still don&#39;t know how deeply</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.359" end="00:40:49.760" style="s2">Dante is involved with Isabella. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.920" end="00:40:52.320" style="s2">blow my cover now. Actually, I was</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.760" end="00:40:53.920" style="s2">trying to say I can&#39;t just treat this as</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.320" end="00:40:56.079" style="s2">a marriage of convenience for the kids</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.920" end="00:40:58.400" style="s2">anymore. No matter how exhausting work</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.079" end="00:41:01.760" style="s2">is, I can&#39;t wait to get home to see the</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.400" end="00:41:03.920" style="s2">kids and to see you. I&#39;ve fallen in love</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.760" end="00:41:05.760" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.920" end="00:41:08.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that what you were holding back?</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.760" end="00:41:11.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.720" end="00:41:14.880" style="s2">I was going to say the same thing. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.440" end="00:41:16.800" style="s2">you for telling me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.880" end="00:41:19.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He trusts me completely, yet I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.800" end="00:41:20.720" style="s2">even tell him what my real job is.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.280" end="00:41:23.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just promised her I wouldn&#39;t lie</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.720" end="00:41:23.720" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.079" end="00:41:35.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.839" end="00:41:35.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; stay behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.880" end="00:41:45.920" style="s2">Who the hell are you? I don&#39;t mean any</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.839" end="00:41:49.359" style="s2">harm.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.920" end="00:41:51.440" style="s2">Then identify yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.359" end="00:41:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, it&#39;s a colleague assigned to</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.440" end="00:41:55.119" style="s2">protect my family.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.520" end="00:41:56.400" style="s2">Don&#39;t get the wrong idea. I asked a</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.119" end="00:41:57.760" style="s2">colleague to come help out.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.400" end="00:41:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would a colleague from a debt</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.760" end="00:42:02.640" style="s2">collection agency be tailing the kids</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.520" end="00:42:04.480" style="s2">and taking photos of them?</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.640" end="00:42:06.079" style="s2">A collection job I handled recently may</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.480" end="00:42:07.440" style="s2">have stirred up trouble. I asked them to</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.079" end="00:42:10.240" style="s2">watch over you and the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.440" end="00:42:14.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.240" end="00:42:14.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t share all the details right now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.000" end="00:42:22.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the kids to school first. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.760" end="00:42:22.440" style="s2">handle this. You should get to work.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.480" end="00:42:31.599" style="s2">Luca, look into everyone Audrey&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.160" end="00:42:33.599" style="s2">in contact with lately, especially</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.599" end="00:42:34.319" style="s2">anyone connected to her work. Don&#39;t tip</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.599" end="00:42:37.319" style="s2">her off.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.319" end="00:42:37.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.079" end="00:42:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Morelli wants to see you alone and</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.760" end="00:42:45.640" style="s2">hear the results of your investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.760" end="00:42:54.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The investigation results you requested.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.280" end="00:43:05.520" style="s2">I can give her the basic background, but</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.359" end="00:43:07.760" style="s2">she can never have my real identity or</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.520" end="00:43:10.480" style="s2">any information about my family.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.760" end="00:43:13.440" style="s2">Diligent at work, independent income</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.480" end="00:43:15.440" style="s2">primarily used to raise her daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.440" end="00:43:16.560" style="s2">Sounds like she works hard. She just</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.440" end="00:43:19.200" style="s2">wants to give her daughter a better</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.560" end="00:43:21.760" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.200" end="00:43:24.079" style="s2">So, does this woman have no flaws at</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.760" end="00:43:24.079" style="s2">all?</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.160" end="00:43:28.920" style="s2">She does. Do tell.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.119" end="00:43:32.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s headstrong and used to making her</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.960" end="00:43:35.040" style="s2">own decisions. Even when people advise</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.960" end="00:43:37.359" style="s2">her, she doesn&#39;t always listen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.040" end="00:43:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.359" end="00:43:41.340" style="s2">She might not be very good with</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.560" end="00:43:43.359" style="s2">authority. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.340" end="00:43:45.040" style="s2">[gasps] The last thing I&#39;m afraid of is</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.359" end="00:43:47.599" style="s2">someone with a mind of her own.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.040" end="00:43:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t mind? She raised a daughter</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.599" end="00:43:52.240" style="s2">all on her own. How could she not have</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.920" end="00:43:53.760" style="s2">an independent mind? Besides, for two</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.240" end="00:43:57.079" style="s2">people living together, both need to</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.760" end="00:43:57.079" style="s2">have a voice.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.715" end="00:44:02.079" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.370" end="00:44:05.800" style="s2">[sighs] Then these things in my book,</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.079" end="00:44:05.800" style="s2">none of those are flaws.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.040" end="00:44:12.640" style="s2">But this is all praise. Are you leaving</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.680" end="00:44:14.400" style="s2">out something important?</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.640" end="00:44:16.800" style="s2">The parts that touch on her private life</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.400" end="00:44:18.480" style="s2">still need verification.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.800" end="00:44:20.560" style="s2">I won&#39;t put unconfirmed claims in</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.480" end="00:44:24.920" style="s2">writing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.560" end="00:44:24.920" style="s2">So, you are holding something back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.079" end="00:44:29.440" style="s2">Fair enough.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.920" end="00:44:34.359" style="s2">Reports don&#39;t always tell the whole</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.440" end="00:44:34.359" style="s2">truth. I&#39;d rather judge her for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.400" end="00:44:40.240" style="s2">Bring the kids over for dinner next</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.920" end="00:44:42.800" style="s2">time. I didn&#39;t get a chance to really</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.240" end="00:44:45.800" style="s2">talk to them last time.</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.800" end="00:44:45.800" style="s2">No,</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.495" end="00:44:53.960" style="s2">[gasps] the kids can&#39;t come here. I just</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.079" end="00:44:53.960" style="s2">wanted to invite them to dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.160" end="00:44:59.839" style="s2">I can&#39;t let her suspect that I&#39;m already</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.839" end="00:45:02.560" style="s2">on guard against her. [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.839" end="00:45:04.319" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I overreacted. The kids had a</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.560" end="00:45:05.440" style="s2">scare recently, and I want to give them</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.319" end="00:45:06.880" style="s2">a few quiet days.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.440" end="00:45:09.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well. We&#39;ll talk about dinner</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.880" end="00:45:12.920" style="s2">another time.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.680" end="00:45:12.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.280" end="00:45:16.839" style="s2">Get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.520" end="00:45:22.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.240" end="00:45:29.079" style="s2">Isabella, I have something to report</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.839" end="00:45:29.079" style="s2">about Dante.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.240" end="00:45:36.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you looking into this woman?</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.560" end="00:45:41.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put the documents down. You don&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.400" end="00:45:43.920" style="s2">to know anything else. And don&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.760" end="00:45:45.359" style="s2">involved without my say off.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.920" end="00:45:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She just looked a bit familiar, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.359" end="00:45:49.200" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.160" end="00:45:50.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t overstep.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.200" end="00:45:52.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.800" end="00:45:55.520" style="s2">She&#39;s the one Dante has been meeting</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.160" end="00:45:58.240" style="s2">with so often.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.520" end="00:46:02.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was it you wanted to report?</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.240" end="00:46:02.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. I think I can handle it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.640" end="00:46:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing in her work history before she</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.240" end="00:46:12.520" style="s2">joined the family raises any red flags.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.800" end="00:46:12.520" style="s2">But we did find this.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.280" end="00:46:19.800" style="s2">She&#39;s been inside this building several</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.800" end="00:46:19.800" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.040" end="00:46:24.800" style="s2">Dante, keeping a woman like this at your</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.880" end="00:46:26.640" style="s2">side, this is exactly what I need to</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.800" end="00:46:29.599" style="s2">take your throne.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.640" end="00:46:31.359" style="s2">Call her in. Don&#39;t mention these photos.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.599" end="00:46:33.040" style="s2">Her debt collection cover checks out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.359" end="00:46:34.800" style="s2">Her work history and outside contacts</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.040" end="00:46:36.880" style="s2">all line up. So far, nothing looks</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.800" end="00:46:38.079" style="s2">suspicious.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.880" end="00:46:39.760" style="s2">Then what about the trouble she</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.079" end="00:46:43.079" style="s2">mentioned? We haven&#39;t found the specific</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.760" end="00:46:43.079" style="s2">debt yet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.800" end="00:46:48.640" style="s2">If she has to have people watching the</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.480" end="00:46:51.119" style="s2">kids, it won&#39;t be just some minor</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.640" end="00:46:53.119" style="s2">dispute. Keep investigating the people</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.119" end="00:46:55.599" style="s2">she&#39;s been in contact with recently. I</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.119" end="00:46:58.599" style="s2">need to know who is threatening her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.599" end="00:46:58.599" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.560" end="00:47:04.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you want to see me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.000" end="00:47:14.400" style="s2">Is visiting the FBI part of your job,</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.079" end="00:47:16.000" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.400" end="00:47:17.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I helped my husband get a security job</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.000" end="00:47:19.200" style="s2">and went with him to complete his</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.119" end="00:47:21.200" style="s2">onboarding paperwork. You can verify the</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.200" end="00:47:24.160" style="s2">records.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.200" end="00:47:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband works security at the FBI?</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.160" end="00:47:27.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.480" end="00:47:30.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And does your husband know you work for</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.839" end="00:47:33.040" style="s2">the Moretti family?</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.720" end="00:47:34.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My family isn&#39;t involved in my work. If</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.040" end="00:47:36.319" style="s2">you have workrelated questions, you can</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.560" end="00:47:38.319" style="s2">ask me directly.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.319" end="00:47:41.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s hiding his identity and she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.319" end="00:47:42.640" style="s2">hiding her job. So even husband and wife</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.040" end="00:47:44.240" style="s2">are keeping this many secrets from each</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.640" end="00:47:47.760" style="s2">other.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.240" end="00:47:49.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t be nervous. Just asking.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.760" end="00:47:52.800" style="s2">Take this file to the Moretti Club</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.440" end="00:47:55.680" style="s2">tonight. Miss Moretti will be waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.800" end="00:47:57.040" style="s2">Put it directly in her hands</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.680" end="00:48:00.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.040" end="00:48:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The address and room number are on it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.880" end="00:48:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.560" end="00:48:11.560" style="s2">Miss Moretti, it&#39;s Audrey. I&#39;m here with</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.400" end="00:48:11.560" style="s2">the file.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.760" end="00:48:21.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Moretti.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.720" end="00:48:38.280" style="s2">This isn&#39;t right. This is not the place</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.640" end="00:48:38.280" style="s2">to hand over documents.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.520" end="00:48:43.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.200" end="00:48:45.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. The person in charge will be here</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.680" end="00:48:47.760" style="s2">any minute.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.839" end="00:48:51.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Miss Morelli?</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.760" end="00:48:55.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll explain when he gets here.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.359" end="00:48:55.160" style="s2">You&#39;d be smart to wait.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.280" end="00:49:00.480" style="s2">Someone is blackmailing using the</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.720" end="00:49:02.960" style="s2">family&#39;s name and using family photos to</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.480" end="00:49:04.720" style="s2">threaten an informant.</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.960" end="00:49:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is she?</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.720" end="00:49:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the clubhouse. I&#39;ve had someone</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.640" end="00:49:10.000" style="s2">detain her. You&#39;d better come here</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.400" end="00:49:13.720" style="s2">yourself to verify.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.000" end="00:49:13.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be there right away.</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.960" end="00:49:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s inside.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.359" end="00:49:25.119" style="s2">I said move. You have no right to keep</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.920" end="00:49:26.720" style="s2">me here.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.119" end="00:49:29.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t leave until the boss gets</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.720" end="00:49:29.720" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.119" end="00:49:39.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.559" end="00:49:39.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.599" end="00:49:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get this document?</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.599" end="00:49:58.960" style="s2">Looks like neither of you had any idea</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.200" end="00:50:00.640" style="s2">what the other was really doing.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.960" end="00:50:03.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not just some regular debt</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.640" end="00:50:06.920" style="s2">collector. I&#39;ve already uncovered your</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.280" end="00:50:06.920" style="s2">connection to the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.800" end="00:50:14.119" style="s2">Now, explain yourself in front of your</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.119" end="00:50:14.119" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.400" end="00:50:18.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t threaten her over suspicion.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.599" end="00:50:21.599" style="s2">Do you know how many times she&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.880" end="00:50:23.839" style="s2">there?</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.599" end="00:50:27.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She got me that security job. So what if</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.839" end="00:50:30.160" style="s2">she&#39;s been there?</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.119" end="00:50:31.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Then explain this. If your husband</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.160" end="00:50:32.880" style="s2">is just a security guard, how can you</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.599" end="00:50:35.040" style="s2">come and go from a ready property</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.880" end="00:50:36.800" style="s2">whenever you want?</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.040" end="00:50:38.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You brought me here and now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.800" end="00:50:40.000" style="s2">petering these things together. What are</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.319" end="00:50:41.440" style="s2">you trying to get me to admit?</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.000" end="00:50:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just asking who you&#39;re actually</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.440" end="00:50:44.800" style="s2">working for.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.720" end="00:50:47.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s baiting me. I can&#39;t let him lead</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.800" end="00:50:47.960" style="s2">the conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.480" end="00:50:52.960" style="s2">He is not involved in my work. Let him</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.960" end="00:50:54.400" style="s2">go first. And if you have any questions,</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.960" end="00:50:56.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll talk to you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.400" end="00:51:00.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, I&#39;m not leaving you here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.000" end="00:51:00.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him go first.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.640" end="00:51:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone here needs my permission to</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.319" end="00:51:08.920" style="s2">leave except him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.280" end="00:51:08.920" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that right, Godfather?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.200" end="00:51:16.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Godfather?</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.880" end="00:51:17.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I&#39;m the head of the Moretti family.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.570" end="00:51:19.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.200" end="00:51:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what about Isabella? Who is she to</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.359" end="00:51:22.960" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.720" end="00:51:24.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.960" end="00:51:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The person seated in the center of that</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.559" end="00:51:28.559" style="s2">photo is his mother. That meeting</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.480" end="00:51:32.319" style="s2">downstairs that night and that task</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.559" end="00:51:34.400" style="s2">asking me to investigate myself. So she</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.319" end="00:51:36.160" style="s2">isn&#39;t just my client. Did you arrange</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.400" end="00:51:36.880" style="s2">for her to have me investigate myself,</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.160" end="00:51:39.040" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.880" end="00:51:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She had you investigate yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.040" end="00:51:46.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. My family, my marriage, and my kid.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.480" end="00:51:48.640" style="s2">I was afraid my work would put you and</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.079" end="00:51:51.040" style="s2">the kids in danger. But she is your</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.640" end="00:51:53.040" style="s2">mother and this family belongs to you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.040" end="00:51:54.640" style="s2">How much do all of you know? Was this</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.040" end="00:51:55.599" style="s2">marriage a setup to watch me from the</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.640" end="00:51:57.280" style="s2">very beginning?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.599" end="00:51:59.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.280" end="00:52:01.520" style="s2">Audrey, I didn&#39;t hide my identity to spy</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.359" end="00:52:02.880" style="s2">on you. Everything I told you about how</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.520" end="00:52:04.000" style="s2">I feel is true.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.880" end="00:52:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what were you talking about</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.000" end="00:52:07.760" style="s2">downstairs that night? Why is it that</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.160" end="00:52:11.960" style="s2">every time I sense danger, the two of</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.760" end="00:52:11.960" style="s2">you already seem to know everything?</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.319" end="00:52:15.839" style="s2">She just wanted to meet the woman I</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.760" end="00:52:17.040" style="s2">married. I kept it from you because I</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.839" end="00:52:20.040" style="s2">still hadn&#39;t figured out how to come</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.040" end="00:52:20.040" style="s2">clean.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.119" end="00:52:25.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do you know who you actually</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.480" end="00:52:25.480" style="s2">married?</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.200" end="00:52:34.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My code name is Night andale.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.960" end="00:52:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Niguel?</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.559" end="00:52:37.680" style="s2">You&#39;re the one I&#39;ve been hunting all</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.760" end="00:52:39.200" style="s2">this time. You agreed to marry me just</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.680" end="00:52:42.720" style="s2">to get close to me. You married me just</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.200" end="00:52:44.240" style="s2">to keep an eye on me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.720" end="00:52:45.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But that day at the park, it was the</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.240" end="00:52:48.319" style="s2">kids who</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.440" end="00:52:50.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo ran off on his own until he called</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.319" end="00:52:52.720" style="s2">me. I had no idea I&#39;d run into you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.319" end="00:52:55.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same with Lily. When I went to the park,</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.720" end="00:52:57.200" style="s2">I had no clue who you were. Then the</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.599" end="00:52:58.640" style="s2">things you said to Lily and everything</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.200" end="00:53:00.880" style="s2">you did for her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.640" end="00:53:03.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love her like my own daughter. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.880" end="00:53:05.680" style="s2">never lied to you about that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.280" end="00:53:07.520" style="s2">What about Theo? How do you feel about</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.680" end="00:53:10.800" style="s2">him? I&#39;ve never thought of him as</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.520" end="00:53:13.680" style="s2">someone else&#39;s child either.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.800" end="00:53:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She admitted it herself. Enough. Hand</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.680" end="00:53:18.319" style="s2">over the FBI agent who infiltrated our</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.680" end="00:53:20.400" style="s2">family right now. Otherwise, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.319" end="00:53:22.400" style="s2">sure everyone in the family knows the</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.400" end="00:53:25.119" style="s2">Godfather is harboring an undercover</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.400" end="00:53:28.000" style="s2">agent.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.119" end="00:53:31.880" style="s2">I&#39;ll investigate the truth myself. No</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.000" end="00:53:31.880" style="s2">one lays a finger on her.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.319" end="00:53:41.800" style="s2">out of the way</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.200" end="00:53:52.599" style="s2">to protect the family. She leaves her</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.960" end="00:53:52.599" style="s2">phone and ID here.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.119" end="00:53:57.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These men only answer to Victor now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.839" end="00:54:06.839" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.119" end="00:54:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to explain those reported cases</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.720" end="00:54:25.040" style="s2">of violent debt collection and</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.920" end="00:54:27.040" style="s2">intimidation first.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.040" end="00:54:28.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m looking into it, too. Someone has</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.040" end="00:54:29.920" style="s2">been operating under the Moretti name. I</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.559" end="00:54:31.839" style="s2">never authorized any of that. But</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.920" end="00:54:34.000" style="s2">they&#39;re using your family&#39;s name, and it</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.839" end="00:54:36.400" style="s2">involves your family&#39;s people. I need</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.000" end="00:54:39.119" style="s2">hard evidence I can verify. I can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.400" end="00:54:40.960" style="s2">take your word for it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.119" end="00:54:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I&#39;ll provide the relevant</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.960" end="00:54:44.240" style="s2">ledgers and personnel records. We&#39;ll go</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.720" end="00:54:47.720" style="s2">through every incident you uncovered,</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.240" end="00:54:47.720" style="s2">one by one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.520" end="00:54:56.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The apartment is empty. Someone took</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.599" end="00:54:56.839" style="s2">both kids.</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.520" end="00:55:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened to the kids?</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.839" end="00:55:04.760" style="s2">They&#39;re not at the apartment. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.440" end="00:55:04.760" style="s2">picked them up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.200" end="00:55:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who took Theo and Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.720" end="00:55:10.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kids knew the person and went along</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.240" end="00:55:11.920" style="s2">willingly. We didn&#39;t stop them by force.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.160" end="00:55:15.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Verify the identity immediately and find</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.920" end="00:55:15.800" style="s2">out where they are right now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.960" end="00:55:23.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother isn&#39;t answering either.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.160" end="00:55:26.839" style="s2">Let&#39;s go back to the apartment and check</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.359" end="00:55:26.839" style="s2">the security footage.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.880" end="00:55:33.400" style="s2">I just pulled the security footage from</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.400" end="00:55:33.400" style="s2">downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.359" end="00:55:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.440" end="00:55:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to make sure they&#39;re safe right</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.800" end="00:55:47.800" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.708" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.400" end="00:56:03.119" style="s2">The children are perfectly safe. Now get</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.280" end="00:56:06.839" style="s2">back here and explain why Victor had you</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.119" end="00:56:06.839" style="s2">detained at the club.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.680" end="00:56:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma. Dad and mom are back. Grandma,</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.760" end="00:56:17.520" style="s2">our house is done.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.200" end="00:56:19.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, can I call her grandma now? Mom, I</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.520" end="00:56:20.880" style="s2">promised Theo I&#39;d help Dad keep the</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.119" end="00:56:22.400" style="s2">secret.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.880" end="00:56:24.079" style="s2">You two didn&#39;t do anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.400" end="00:56:26.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told Theo not to call her grandma for</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.079" end="00:56:28.480" style="s2">now. He was just listening to me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.880" end="00:56:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, whatever happens between</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.480" end="00:56:32.799" style="s2">adults, we settle it ourselves. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.480" end="00:56:33.520" style="s2">not make the children carry our secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.799" end="00:56:35.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.520" end="00:56:37.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go play for a bit. We need to talk to</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.119" end="00:56:39.839" style="s2">your grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.280" end="00:56:41.040" style="s2">Talk? Why did Victor corner you at the</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.839" end="00:56:43.760" style="s2">clubhouse?</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.040" end="00:56:47.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He found out what Audrey really does. He</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.760" end="00:56:49.520" style="s2">tried to force me to turn her over.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.119" end="00:56:52.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does she do?</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.520" end="00:56:54.240" style="s2">I&#39;m an FBI agent.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.400" end="00:56:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re with the FBI?</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.240" end="00:56:58.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t know? All I knew was that</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.000" end="00:56:59.200" style="s2">you&#39;re the woman my son just married. I</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.079" end="00:57:00.160" style="s2">always thought you&#39;d figure out every</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.200" end="00:57:02.400" style="s2">time you brought up my husband and</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.160" end="00:57:04.000" style="s2">child, you were warning me. I just</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.400" end="00:57:06.000" style="s2">wanted to know what kind of woman my son</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.000" end="00:57:07.520" style="s2">had married.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.000" end="00:57:09.520" style="s2">When I asked if you could keep your</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.520" end="00:57:12.000" style="s2">husband&#39;s secrets, I was referring to</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.520" end="00:57:15.960" style="s2">Dante&#39;s true identity. I was never</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.000" end="00:57:15.960" style="s2">threatening you with your family.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.720" end="00:57:21.280" style="s2">And now, now that you know who your</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.200" end="00:57:24.079" style="s2">husband is, will you still keep</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.280" end="00:57:27.119" style="s2">investigating him?</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.079" end="00:57:30.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. If he truly did those things, I</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.119" end="00:57:30.760" style="s2">won&#39;t cover for him.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.000" end="00:57:37.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luca, bring me the ledgers and payment</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.920" end="00:57:38.240" style="s2">receipts tied to those debt collection</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.359" end="00:57:39.520" style="s2">complaints.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.240" end="00:57:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to hand the family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.520" end="00:57:42.480" style="s2">records over to her?</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.880" end="00:57:46.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t expect her to believe every word</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.480" end="00:57:46.319" style="s2">I say just because she&#39;s married to me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.799" end="00:57:52.400" style="s2">The ledgers, transfer receipts, and</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.960" end="00:57:54.480" style="s2">bills for the hospital and temporary</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.400" end="00:57:55.920" style="s2">loing are all here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.480" end="00:57:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These payments were listed in the</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.920" end="00:57:59.680" style="s2">reports as proceeds from illegal debt</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.680" end="00:58:00.960" style="s2">collection, but the money actually went</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.680" end="00:58:02.559" style="s2">out from the family accounts for</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.960" end="00:58:03.920" style="s2">hospital bills and temporary housing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.559" end="00:58:04.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bills list the corresponding</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.920" end="00:58:06.240" style="s2">recipients.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.720" end="00:58:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The amounts check out, but that doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.240" end="00:58:09.599" style="s2">prove no one was threatened or hurt. I</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.240" end="00:58:10.720" style="s2">want to speak to the people involved and</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.599" end="00:58:12.400" style="s2">verify it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.720" end="00:58:15.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair enough. I&#39;ll give you their contact</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.400" end="00:58:18.079" style="s2">info, too. And this tip, I found it at</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.280" end="00:58:20.079" style="s2">the FBI.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.079" end="00:58:21.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same person, two completely different</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.079" end="00:58:23.040" style="s2">stories.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.680" end="00:58:26.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like we need to reach out to this</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.040" end="00:58:26.040" style="s2">witness.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.680" end="00:58:32.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.799" end="00:58:35.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello. This is Special Agent Audrey</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.880" end="00:58:38.960" style="s2">Carter with the FBI. I&#39;d like to verify</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.119" end="00:58:41.200" style="s2">a few details about the Meridia.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.960" end="00:58:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll use the family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.200" end="00:58:48.520" style="s2">resources to track him down. Dante, did</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.480" end="00:58:48.520" style="s2">you forget I&#39;m an FBI agent?</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.440" end="00:58:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante won&#39;t be part of this</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.640" end="00:58:55.200" style="s2">conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.200" end="00:58:56.400" style="s2">Those two statements don&#39;t match. Today,</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.200" end="00:58:57.119" style="s2">all you need to do is tell me what</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.400" end="00:58:58.559" style="s2">really happened.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.119" end="00:59:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The people who came after me for money</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.559" end="00:59:02.240" style="s2">claimed they worked for Moretti. I was</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.160" end="00:59:03.760" style="s2">terrified not to pay. It wasn&#39;t until</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.240" end="00:59:04.000" style="s2">later that I found out Dante never sent</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.760" end="00:59:04.960" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.000" end="00:59:06.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why report him?</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.960" end="00:59:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone wrote out a script and told me</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.240" end="00:59:09.520" style="s2">to report him word for word. I had to</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.920" end="00:59:11.440" style="s2">say Dante ordered it. They knew where my</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.520" end="00:59:13.040" style="s2">family lived. What choice did I have?</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.440" end="00:59:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a look. Do you recognize any of</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.040" end="00:59:17.520" style="s2">these people?</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.680" end="00:59:18.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him. He&#39;s the one who gave me THE</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.520" end="00:59:20.960" style="s2">SCRIPT. IT WAS HIM.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.799" end="00:59:22.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Victor&#39;s [music] man. Put him under</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.960" end="00:59:22.799" style="s2">protection and contact his family</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.160" end="00:59:24.319" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.799" end="00:59:25.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could they have already gone after them?</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.319" end="00:59:30.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll check on them. [music] You stay</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.839" end="00:59:30.520" style="s2">here for now. Don&#39;t go out on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.720" end="00:59:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the restroom?</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.920" end="00:59:40.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t just sit here waiting for news.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.000" end="00:59:40.040" style="s2">I have to go check on them myself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.559" end="00:59:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s gone. He&#39;s not in the restroom</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.319" end="00:59:45.839" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.160" end="00:59:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contact security at the exits. Find out</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.839" end="00:59:51.000" style="s2">which way he went now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.040" end="00:59:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My people will help with the search.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.319" end="00:59:59.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want him alive, send Dante alone.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.119" end="01:00:04.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t go alone.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.119" end="01:00:06.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He could hurt the witness at any second.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.640" end="01:00:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is why we can&#39;t just play by his</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.000" end="01:00:09.040" style="s2">rules. If you go in there, what happens</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.440" end="01:00:12.480" style="s2">when he goes back on his word? You</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.040" end="01:00:15.040" style="s2">promise no more going behind my back.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.480" end="01:00:15.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, this time we figure it out</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.040" end="01:00:16.640" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.599" end="01:00:17.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send the video and address to the</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.640" end="01:00:18.559" style="s2">tactical team. Have them assess the</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.839" end="01:00:20.000" style="s2">scene. Understood.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.559" end="01:00:21.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Backup is in position. We&#39;re waiting for</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.000" end="01:00:23.520" style="s2">you to confirm the hostage condition.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.839" end="01:00:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep him calm once you get inside. Do</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.520" end="01:00:25.680" style="s2">not provoke him until we know the</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.720" end="01:00:28.480" style="s2">hostage is safe.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.680" end="01:00:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time, no more secrets between us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.480" end="01:00:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then come back to me in one piece. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.040" end="01:00:35.000" style="s2">talk about the rest when we&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.319" end="01:00:42.559" style="s2">You actually showed up alone. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.880" end="01:00:44.400" style="s2">already standing here. Let him go first.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.559" end="01:00:46.319" style="s2">You&#39;re going to do what I asked.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.400" end="01:00:48.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hostages confirmed alive, guarded by</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.319" end="01:00:51.359" style="s2">hostiles. Stand by for my command.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.799" end="01:00:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it. Step away from family business.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.359" end="01:00:55.440" style="s2">The Morettes won&#39;t need you at the helm</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.960" end="01:00:57.280" style="s2">anymore. All this trouble just for this</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.440" end="01:00:59.440" style="s2">seat. It was never meant to be yours</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.280" end="01:01:01.440" style="s2">alone. And divorce FBI special agent</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.440" end="01:01:03.839" style="s2">Audrey Carter. Then publicly accuse her</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.440" end="01:01:06.000" style="s2">of coercing a witness into perjury. You</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.839" end="01:01:09.559" style="s2">can always marry another woman, but he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.000" end="01:01:09.559" style="s2">only got one life.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.000" end="01:01:14.559" style="s2">I won&#39;t sacrifice Audrey to cover your</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.760" end="01:01:16.000" style="s2">crimes. Take a look around. You&#39;re in no</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.559" end="01:01:17.839" style="s2">position to bargain with me. You</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.000" end="01:01:20.480" style="s2">arranged those reports and the debt</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.839" end="01:01:22.559" style="s2">collectors were your men, too. What else</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.480" end="01:01:24.160" style="s2">was I supposed to do? Sit back and watch</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.559" end="01:01:26.079" style="s2">you waste family money on those broke</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.160" end="01:01:27.760" style="s2">losers. So, you used the Morelli name to</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.079" end="01:01:29.280" style="s2">shake them down and then forced them to</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.760" end="01:01:31.440" style="s2">frame me? The second they heard your</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.280" end="01:01:32.640" style="s2">name, they paid up. I took the money and</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.440" end="01:01:33.520" style="s2">you took the blame. We got the</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.640" end="01:01:35.040" style="s2">confession on tape.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.520" end="01:01:38.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m moving toward the hostage. Get ready</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.040" end="01:01:38.520" style="s2">to back me up.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.200" end="01:01:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew they had no money to pay, yet</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.720" end="01:01:44.240" style="s2">you still threaten their families. If</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.880" end="01:01:46.160" style="s2">you don&#39;t threaten their families, how</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.240" end="01:01:48.160" style="s2">else do you keep them in line? Just like</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.160" end="01:01:50.960" style="s2">you. Without that woman, would you be</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.160" end="01:01:52.799" style="s2">standing here like a good little boy?</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.960" end="01:01:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look back. If you can stand,</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.799" end="01:01:57.040" style="s2">follow me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.000" end="01:02:01.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SOMEONE&#39;S HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.040" end="01:02:01.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FBI, DROP YOUR WEAPON.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.839" end="01:02:06.880" style="s2">Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.040" end="01:02:07.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him go. You have nowhere left to</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.880" end="01:02:09.839" style="s2">run.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.680" end="01:02:13.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one you want. Take the gun off</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.839" end="01:02:16.799" style="s2">him. I knew you&#39;d bring the cops.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.680" end="01:02:19.520" style="s2">So, make your choice. Who do you save</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.799" end="01:02:21.440" style="s2">first? Her or him?</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.520" end="01:02:24.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can barely breathe.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.440" end="01:02:25.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t try to bargain with me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.079" end="01:02:28.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In position by the side door, waiting</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.599" end="01:02:28.920" style="s2">for an opening.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.520" end="01:02:34.400" style="s2">You want me to stay? I&#39;ll stay. Let them</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.599" end="01:02:36.240" style="s2">go first. So now you&#39;re begging. You</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.400" end="01:02:38.400" style="s2">want my position. Once I&#39;m in your</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.240" end="01:02:41.640" style="s2">hands, what are you afraid of? Go tie</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.400" end="01:02:41.640" style="s2">him up.</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.359" end="01:02:46.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get down.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.160" end="01:02:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freeze. Hands where I can see them.</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.040" end="01:02:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FBI, DROP YOUR WEAPONS.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.319" end="01:03:08.000" style="s2">get him outside for a medical check and</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.920" end="01:03:13.400" style="s2">notify his family that he&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.000" end="01:03:13.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Thank you both so much.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.799" end="01:03:18.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t just arrest me. Everything was</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.880" end="01:03:20.720" style="s2">done under the Moretti name. Your</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.640" end="01:03:22.000" style="s2">financial records are secured and we</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.720" end="01:03:24.079" style="s2">recorded your confession to the</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.000" end="01:03:27.280" style="s2">extortion and false reports. You can</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.079" end="01:03:28.799" style="s2">explain the rest to the investigators.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.280" end="01:03:31.520" style="s2">Saving your husband doesn&#39;t make him</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.799" end="01:03:32.720" style="s2">innocent.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.520" end="01:03:36.440" style="s2">Do you have the guts to let them</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.720" end="01:03:36.440" style="s2">investigate him, too?</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.480" end="01:03:42.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.680" end="01:03:46.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.319" end="01:03:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; are you regretting marrying me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.240" end="01:03:49.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then, you thought I was an</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.680" end="01:03:51.520" style="s2">underpaid security guard. The man you</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.760" end="01:03:53.440" style="s2">agreed to build a life with isn&#39;t the</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.520" end="01:03:55.760" style="s2">man standing in front of you now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.440" end="01:03:57.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not moving out.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.760" end="01:03:59.520" style="s2">These are work files. Now that you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.599" end="01:04:02.160" style="s2">involved in the investigation, I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.520" end="01:04:04.240" style="s2">just leave them lying around the house.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.160" end="01:04:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why have you been avoiding me?</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.240" end="01:04:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just don&#39;t know how to trust you</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.520" end="01:04:10.319" style="s2">anymore. You fixing Lily&#39;s toys, reading</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.079" end="01:04:12.079" style="s2">bedtime stories to Theo. I know all of</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.319" end="01:04:14.319" style="s2">that was real, but whenever I think</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.079" end="01:04:16.160" style="s2">about it, I wonder beyond the side you</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.319" end="01:04:17.359" style="s2">showed me. How much else did you decide</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.160" end="01:04:18.960" style="s2">I should never know?</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.359" end="01:04:19.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never planned to hide things from you</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.960" end="01:04:21.359" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.680" end="01:04:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But deciding when to tell me was always</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.359" end="01:04:26.720" style="s2">entirely up to you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.400" end="01:04:28.960" style="s2">I hid my identity, too. I can&#39;t expect</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.720" end="01:04:31.039" style="s2">you to forgive me overnight. But I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.960" end="01:04:32.319" style="s2">want us to keep hiding things and making</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.039" end="01:04:33.520" style="s2">decisions on each other&#39;s behalf</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.319" end="01:04:34.960" style="s2">whenever trouble comes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.520" end="01:04:35.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you everything the family is</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.960" end="01:04:37.200" style="s2">involved in.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.920" end="01:04:37.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the things you don&#39;t want me to</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.200" end="01:04:41.880" style="s2">know,</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.680" end="01:04:41.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; even the parts you might hate me for.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.760" end="01:04:48.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you both this sad because we made</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.440" end="01:04:48.839" style="s2">you get married?</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.079" end="01:05:03.440" style="s2">That day, I was the one who insisted on</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.720" end="01:05:06.799" style="s2">finding dad a wife. And I was the one</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.440" end="01:05:08.319" style="s2">who made mom go on the blind date.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.799" end="01:05:10.079" style="s2">We won&#39;t make you sleep together</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.319" end="01:05:12.000" style="s2">anymore. And we won&#39;t make you read</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.079" end="01:05:14.400" style="s2">stories together either. [snorts] Can</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.000" end="01:05:18.039" style="s2">you please not separate Theo and me? I</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.400" end="01:05:18.039" style="s2">don&#39;t want to move away.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.280" end="01:05:26.240" style="s2">I can have fewer toys, too. And we don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.280" end="01:05:29.960" style="s2">need a bigger place. The four of us can</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.240" end="01:05:29.960" style="s2">just stay right here.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.760" end="01:05:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo, look at me. You two only</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.400" end="01:05:40.079" style="s2">introduced us. Getting married was a</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.400" end="01:05:41.440" style="s2">decision your mom and I made ourselves,</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.079" end="01:05:43.039" style="s2">not you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.440" end="01:05:45.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was the one who asked him if he wanted</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.039" end="01:05:47.785" style="s2">to get married, and he said yes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.765" end="01:05:47.785" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.160" end="01:05:50.799" style="s2">You didn&#39;t just agree because we kept</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.839" end="01:05:56.200" style="s2">begging.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.799" end="01:05:56.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m an adult and I own my choices.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.400" end="01:06:00.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not telling the truth later and arguing</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.640" end="01:06:04.760" style="s2">when things got tough, that was on us.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.880" end="01:06:04.760" style="s2">You two did nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.200" end="01:06:12.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about now?</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.720" end="01:06:15.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you still want to be a family with</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.319" end="01:06:15.319" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.160" end="01:06:21.160" style="s2">Yes,</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.520" end="01:06:30.200" style="s2">I do too.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.640" end="01:06:30.200" style="s2">I always have.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.920" end="01:06:43.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any news on the investigation?</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.119" end="01:06:43.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have findings we needed to give you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.681" end="01:06:50.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.160" end="01:06:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We verified the witness statements,</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.079" end="01:06:53.359" style="s2">financial records, and communications</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.839" end="01:06:56.799" style="s2">tied to the violent collection and</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.359" end="01:06:59.039" style="s2">intimidation cases.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.799" end="01:07:00.720" style="s2">Victor was behind all of it. The</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.039" end="01:07:02.559" style="s2">disclosure regarding your marriage and</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.720" end="01:07:04.319" style="s2">potential conflict of interest has also</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.559" end="01:07:06.160" style="s2">cleared review. Any further direct</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.319" end="01:07:07.520" style="s2">investigations involving Melli will be</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.160" end="01:07:11.960" style="s2">handled over to other agents.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.520" end="01:07:11.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. I&#39;ll complete the handover.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.039" end="01:07:16.480" style="s2">Now, can I just ask you directly what</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.039" end="01:07:18.400" style="s2">time you get off work tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.480" end="01:07:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can. And you don&#39;t have to ask how</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.400" end="01:07:21.280" style="s2">many debts I still have to collect.</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.000" end="01:07:25.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you won&#39;t have to set up security</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.280" end="01:07:25.160" style="s2">guard interviews for me anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.640" end="01:07:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, can we put all four of us on</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.319" end="01:07:31.200" style="s2">the cake? There have to be bunnies and</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.920" end="01:07:33.200" style="s2">race cars, too.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.200" end="01:07:34.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll put all of that on it. And since</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.200" end="01:07:38.400" style="s2">it&#39;s your parents wedding, you two need</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.799" end="01:07:40.160" style="s2">to dress up, too. Wedding?</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.400" end="01:07:41.599" style="s2">You never had a ceremony. and our</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.160" end="01:07:43.520" style="s2">friends and family still haven&#39;t met</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.599" end="01:07:45.680" style="s2">Audrey. It&#39;s time we made a proper</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.520" end="01:07:46.720" style="s2">introduction. Take a look. What date do</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.680" end="01:07:49.280" style="s2">you want?</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.720" end="01:07:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, can I carry your train?</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.280" end="01:07:52.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, hold on a second.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.880" end="01:07:54.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything&#39;s been cleared up. What are</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.319" end="01:07:57.839" style="s2">you still hesitating for?</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.720" end="01:08:00.240" style="s2">You don&#39;t want a wedding?</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.839" end="01:08:01.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do, but last time the kids chose for</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.240" end="01:08:03.440" style="s2">us. [music] This time, I want it to be</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.760" end="01:08:07.559" style="s2">your choice. Give me a chance to propose</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.440" end="01:08:07.559" style="s2">to you properly. Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.440" end="01:08:13.119" style="s2">here again.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.240" end="01:08:16.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time I came prepared.</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.119" end="01:08:19.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theo, stay down. It&#39;s not our turn to</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.159" end="01:08:20.159" style="s2">come out yet.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.037" end="01:08:24.359" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.159" end="01:08:24.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on out. We already see you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.480" end="01:08:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, those are terms I can agree to.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.400" end="01:08:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Audrey. I&#39;m Dante Moretti. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.279" end="01:08:36.719" style="s2">Theo&#39;s father and the head of the</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.880" end="01:08:38.880" style="s2">Moretti family. I&#39;m not an ordinary</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.719" end="01:08:40.400" style="s2">security guard. and that apartment</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.880" end="01:08:41.600" style="s2">wasn&#39;t where I originally lived.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.400" end="01:08:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you need to think this through,</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.600" end="01:08:45.920" style="s2">too. I&#39;m still an FBI agent. If there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.480" end="01:08:47.520" style="s2">something to investigate, I will</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.920" end="01:08:48.640" style="s2">investigate it. I won&#39;t blindly take</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.520" end="01:08:49.279" style="s2">your side just because you&#39;re my</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.640" end="01:08:51.120" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.279" end="01:08:55.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you made that clear the very</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.120" end="01:08:55.080" style="s2">first time you found out who I was.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.000" end="01:08:59.600" style="s2">You stay true to your calling and you</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.839" end="01:09:01.120" style="s2">stop me when I&#39;m wrong. You love the</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.600" end="01:09:02.560" style="s2">kids fiercely and you never make</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.120" end="01:09:04.640" style="s2">yourself smaller just to please someone</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.560" end="01:09:07.440" style="s2">else. That&#39;s exactly the woman I fell in</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.640" end="01:09:10.440" style="s2">love with. Audrey, will you choose me</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.440" end="01:09:10.440" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.719" end="01:09:16.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s one more thing you have to</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.839" end="01:09:18.400" style="s2">promise me first. We can&#39;t ever make</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.239" end="01:09:19.520" style="s2">them cover for our lies again. And we</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.400" end="01:09:21.040" style="s2">can&#39;t let them feel like they have to</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.520" end="01:09:23.440" style="s2">keep secrets just to keep this family</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.040" end="01:09:26.080" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.440" end="01:09:27.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed. Whatever they don&#39;t understand,</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.080" end="01:09:29.279" style="s2">we&#39;ll talk through with them patiently.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.679" end="01:09:29.839" style="s2">Grown-up problems are for grown-ups to</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.279" end="01:09:33.880" style="s2">handle.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.839" end="01:09:33.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then yes, I will.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.040" end="01:09:43.759" style="s2">This time I get to be in the wedding,</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.199" end="01:09:46.000" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.759" end="01:09:48.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too. You can&#39;t leave us waiting on</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.000" end="01:09:50.239" style="s2">the sidelines again.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.159" end="01:09:51.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, you&#39;re in it. You two are the</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.239" end="01:09:53.120" style="s2">most important people to us.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.359" end="01:09:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But there&#39;s a very special job for you</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.120" end="01:09:58.040" style="s2">two at the wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.560" end="01:09:58.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.239" end="01:10:05.803" style="s2">This time our job was just walking her</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.560" end="01:10:06.320" style="s2">over. The rest is up to you two.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.803" end="01:10:07.440" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.320" end="01:10:08.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, we&#39;ll make the promises</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.440" end="01:10:11.199" style="s2">ourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.320" end="01:10:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dante, do you take Audrey as your wife</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.199" end="01:10:15.760" style="s2">to share your life with her? Respect her</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.440" end="01:10:16.400" style="s2">choices and always be honest with her.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.760" end="01:10:18.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.400" end="01:10:20.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, do you take Dante as your</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.480" end="01:10:23.320" style="s2">husband?</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.080" end="01:10:23.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.159" end="01:10:30.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may now kiss your bride.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.880" end="01:10:30.440" style="s2">May I kiss you?</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
